  "body": [
    "Register for Fall Programming! Session runs now - Nov 8.",
    "PLAY PLAY submenu Programs Private Lessons Adult Camps Summer Camps Book a Court Free30 Dave Bailey Programs",
    "EVENTS EVENTS submenu Calendar 2026 BNP Paribas World Team Cup",
    "ABOUT ABOUT submenu Meet Our Team Contact Us Sponsors & Partners USTA National Campus Scholarship",
    "WATCH WATCH submenu Watch Live Record Your Match",
    "VISIT VISIT submenu Hotel Booking Sustainability Health & Wellness Shop",
    "Home >",
    "Play >",
    "Padel Programs",
    "Padel is the dynamic racquet sport that blends tennis and squash. Fast-paced and social, it’s easy to learn the fundamentals, but the challenge lies in mastering the strategy of playing off the walls.",
    "For either a one-time or two-time fee, unlock padel court rentals for a WHOLE YEAR! Purchase your pass today and hit the padel courts!",
    "INSTRUCTIONAL",
    "PRACTICE TO PLAY",
    "SOCIAL PLAY",
    "COMPETITION",
    "Learn the game or brush up your skills if it has been a while since you last played. Drop-in reservations open 1-week prior to the class date. Level: New Padel player, no experience.",
    "Continue advancing your skills! Players will need to have completed Padel 101 or be evaluated by coach. Players should know the fundamentals and be able to utilize the walls. Drop-in reservations open 1-week prior to the class date. Level: New Padel player, limited experience.",
    "The \"Innovation Clinic\" leverages the advanced Volley ball machine to isolate and perfect your padel strokes. Players of all levels will benefit from this tight focus on technical precision. Drill down on footwork, racket prep, and contact points to build a better padel game.",
    "Senior Padel Professional, Gavin Hendry",
    "gavin.hendry@usta.com",
    "Monday - Friday 7:00 AM - 9:00 PM",
    "Saturday 7:00 AM - 5:00 PM",
    "Sunday 7:00 AM - 5:00 PM",
